{"path":"coroutine/coroutine_handle/operator=","title":"std::coroutine_handle<Promise>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::coroutine_handle&lt;Promise&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/coroutine/coroutine_handle/operator=","section":"coroutine","kind":"page","summary":"Replaces the underlying address.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">coroutine_handle<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/nullptr_t\"><span class=\"kw109\">std::<span class=\"me2\">nullptr_t</span></span></a> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">coroutine_handle<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> coroutine_handle<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw1\">default</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">coroutine_handle<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> coroutine_handle<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw1\">default</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Replaces the underlying address.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Replaces the underlying address with a null pointer value. After assignment, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> does not refer to a coroutine. This assignment operator is not declared for specialization <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/coroutine_handle\"><span class=\"kw3228\">std::<span class=\"me2\">coroutine_handle</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/noop_coroutine_promise\"><span class=\"kw3269\">std::<span class=\"me2\">noop_coroutine_promise</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2,3)</span> Replaces the underlying address with the one of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>. Copy and move assignment operators are equivalent to implicitly declared ones.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another <code>coroutine_handle</code> to assign from\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"coroutine","title":"Coroutine support (C++20)"},{"path":"coroutine/coroutine_handle","title":"std::coroutine_handle, std::noop_coroutine_handle"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::coroutine_handle<Promise>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Replaces the underlying address."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":93,"codeBlockCount":0}
